    },
    "A club": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A club page has photos, the city, music genres and minimum age, then Popular and Coming Soon events, a map with the address, Contact (email, phone, Instagram, website) and a description. Tap an event to open it.\n\nTap Follow to follow a club — you get a notification when it posts a new event (allow notifications when Outly asks, or turn them on under Preferences). Tap Following to stop. To report a club, tap the … menu at the top right and choose Report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stran kluba ima fotografije, mesto, glasbene žanre in najnižjo starost, nato dogodke Priljubljeno in Kmalu na sporedu, zemljevid z naslovom, Kontakt (e-pošta, telefon, Instagram, spletna stran) in opis. Tapni dogodek, da ga odpreš.\n\nTapni Sledi, da klubu slediš — ko objavi nov dogodek, dobiš obvestilo (dovoli obvestila, ko te Outly vpraša, ali jih vklopi pod Nastavitve). Tapni Sledim, da nehaš slediti. Klub prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A guest list is set up by Outly for an event, with you as the host and a set number of spots. It appears under Profile > Tickets > Guest lists, and you get your own ticket with a QR code under Tickets.\n\nOpen the guest list and tap Invite friends, choose friends from your list and confirm. Each friend gets their own ticket with their own QR code and can arrive separately. To free a spot, tap the x next to a friend before they have entered — their ticket stops working.\n\nIf a friend adds you to their guest list, you get a notification and the ticket appears under Tickets as Invited by @name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seznam gostov za dogodek nastavi Outly; ti si gostitelj z določenim številom mest. Prikaže se pod Profil > Vstopnice > Seznami gostov, svojo vstopnico s QR kodo pa dobiš pod Vstopnice.\n\nOdpri seznam gostov in tapni Povabi prijatelje, izberi prijatelje s seznama in potrdi. Vsak prijatelj dobi svojo vstopnico s svojo QR kodo in lahko pride ločeno. Mesto sprostiš tako, da tapneš x ob prijatelju, preden je vstopil — njegova vstopnica preneha veljati.\n\nČe te prijatelj doda na svoj seznam gostov, dobiš obvestilo, vstopnica pa se pod Vstopnice pokaže kot Povabil te je @ime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
