    },
    "Bought tickets for the whole group? Open a ticket and tap Send to a friend, then enter your friend's Outly email.\n\nThe ticket moves to their account with a new QR code — your old code stops working. Your friend needs an Outly account with a confirmed email and must meet the event's age limit.\n\nTickets can be sent until the event starts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si kupil(a) vstopnice za celo druščino? Odpri vstopnico in tapni Send to a friend (pošlji prijatelju), nato vnesi e-pošto prijateljevega Outly računa.\n\nVstopnica se prenese na njegov/njen račun z novo kodo QR — tvoja stara koda preneha delovati. Prijatelj potrebuje Outly račun s potrjeno e-pošto in mora izpolnjevati starostno omejitev dogodka.\n\nVstopnice lahko pošiljaš do začetka dogodka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bought tickets for the whole group? Open a ticket and tap Send to a friend. Choose a friend from your list, or tap Send by email instead and enter their email, then tap Send ticket and confirm.\n\nThe ticket moves to their account with a new QR code — your old code stops working. Your friend needs an Outly account with a confirmed email and must meet the event's age limit. (Where the screen says we'll email them the ticket, a friend without an account can get it by email too.) For events with an age limit you confirm that your friend is old enough.\n\nTickets can be sent until the event starts. Guest list tickets can't be sent.\n\nIf the event is cancelled, the refund goes to the original buyer, not to the person you send the ticket to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si kupil vstopnice za celo družbo? Odpri vstopnico in tapni Pošlji prijatelju. Izberi prijatelja s seznama ali tapni Raje pošlji po e-pošti in vpiši njegov e-poštni naslov, nato tapni Pošlji vstopnico in potrdi.\n\nVstopnica preide na njegov račun z novo QR kodo — tvoja stara koda preneha veljati. Prijatelj potrebuje Outly račun s potrjeno e-pošto in mora izpolnjevati starostno mejo dogodka. (Kjer zaslon pove, da mu vstopnico pošljemo po e-pošti, jo lahko prejme po e-pošti tudi prijatelj brez računa.) Pri dogodkih s starostno mejo potrdiš, da je prijatelj dovolj star.\n\nVstopnice lahko pošlješ do začetka dogodka. Vstopnic s seznama gostov ni mogoče pošiljati naprej.\n\nČe je dogodek odpovedan, vračilo dobi prvotni kupec, ne oseba, ki ji vstopnico pošlješ."
          }
        }
      }
    },
