    "Getting started  >  Navigation": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prvi koraki  >  Krmarjenje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to My Account > Delete account. Your personal data is removed; records of past purchases are kept anonymised, as required for accounting.\n\nValid tickets on a deleted account cannot be recovered, so use them or send them to a friend first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pojdi na Moj račun > Izbriši račun. Tvoji osebni podatki bodo izbrisani; zapisi preteklih nakupov ostanejo anonimizirani, kot to zahteva računovodstvo.\n\nVeljavnih vstopnic na izbrisanem računu ni mogoče obnoviti, zato jih najprej uporabi ali pošlji prijatelju."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to My Account > Request for creator and fill in the short form. We review requests by hand — you can follow the status on the same screen.\n\nOnce approved, your profile switches to the business view: Dashboard, Events, Scan tickets and Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pojdi na Moj račun > Prošnja za ustvarjalca in izpolni kratek obrazec. Prošnje pregledamo ročno — stanje lahko spremljaš na istem zaslonu.\n\nKo je odobrena, se tvoj profil preklopi na poslovni pogled: Pregled, Dogodki, Skeniraj vstopnice in Nastavitve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to My Account > Request for creator and fill in the short form. We review requests by hand — you can follow the status on the same screen.\n\nOnce approved, your profile switches to the business view: Edit your page, Dashboard, Events, My team and Settings (if it does not, log out and log in again). Scanning tickets is under Profile > My Clubs — see Scan tickets at the door.\n\nOwners can switch between the club and the personal profile: Settings > Switch to personal account, and back with My Account > Switch to club account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pojdi na Moj račun > Prošnja za ustvarjalca in izpolni kratek obrazec. Prošnje pregledamo ročno — stanje spremljaš na istem zaslonu.\n\nKo je prošnja odobrena, se tvoj profil preklopi na poslovni pogled: Uredi svojo stran, Pregled, Dogodki, My team (ekipa), Settings (nastavitve) (če se ne, se odjavi in znova prijavi). Skeniranje vstopnic je pod Profil > Moji klubi — glej Skeniranje vstopnic pri vhodu.\n\nLastnik lahko preklaplja med klubskim in osebnim profilom: Settings (nastavitve) > Switch to personal account (preklop na osebni račun), nazaj pa z Moj račun > Switch to club account (preklop na klubski račun)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Profile > My Account > Password and security. Under Login tap Edit, enter your current password and the new one twice, then tap Done. Other devices are signed out; this one stays signed in.\n\nUnder Sessions tap Sign out and confirm to sign out of all devices, including this one. To log out of this device only, tap Log out at the bottom of Profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Moj račun > Geslo in varnost. Pod Prijava tapni Uredi, vpiši trenutno geslo in dvakrat novo, nato tapni Končano. Druge naprave se odjavijo, ta ostane prijavljena.\n\nPod Seje tapni Odjava in potrdi, da se odjaviš z vseh naprav, tudi s te. Če se želiš odjaviti samo s te naprave, tapni Odjava na dnu zavihka Profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Profile > My Account > Personal info. Tap the picture with the + to add or change your profile photo. Each card — Username, Phone number, Date of birth and Country — has an Edit button. Your username needs 3–20 characters: letters, numbers and underscore.\n\nYour email can't be changed in the app; to change it, write to luka@outly.si.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Moj račun > Osebni podatki. Tapni sliko s plusom, da dodaš ali zamenjaš profilno fotografijo. Vsaka kartica — Uporabniško ime, Telefonska številka, Datum rojstva in Država — ima gumb Uredi. Uporabniško ime mora imeti 3–20 znakov: črke, števke in podčrtaj.\n\nE-pošte v aplikaciji ni mogoče spremeniti; če jo želiš spremeniti, piši na luka@outly.si."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Profile > My Account > Preferences > Notifications and tap Turn on notifications. You get a notification for a ticket someone sent you, new events from clubs you follow, an invitation to a guest list and, for club staff, table service requests.\n\nIf you said no earlier, turn them on in iOS Settings. Sign-up and password codes always arrive by email.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Moj račun > Nastavitve > Obvestila in tapni Vklopi obvestila. Obvestilo dobiš za vstopnico, ki ti jo je kdo poslal, nove dogodke klubov, katerim slediš, vabilo na seznam gostov in — za osebje kluba — zahteve za strežbo miz.\n\nČe si prej rekel(-a) ne, jih vklopi v nastavitvah iOS. Kode za registracijo in geslo vedno prispejo po e-pošti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Profile > My Account > Preferences. My preferences saves your favourite music genres, maximum distance, age range and ticket price range on this phone; switch on Use my preferences in Filters to apply them.\n\nLanguage switches the app between English and Slovenščina straight away. Notifications is where you turn on push notifications. Friends can see my plans decides whether your friends see which events you are going to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Moj račun > Nastavitve. Moje nastavitve shranijo tvoje najljubše glasbene žanre, največjo razdaljo, starostni razpon in razpon cene vstopnice na tem telefonu; vklopi Uporabi moje nastavitve v Filtrih, da se uporabijo.\n\nJezik takoj preklopi aplikacijo med English in Slovenščina. Pri Obvestila vklopiš potisna obvestila. Prijatelji vidijo moje načrte določa, ali prijatelji vidijo, na katere dogodke greš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Going": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
