            "value": "Gostje seznam vidijo pod \"Cenik bara\" na vsakem dogodku kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guests see this list on every event of your club. Category is optional (e.g. Beer, Cocktails).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gostje ta seznam vidijo pri vsakem dogodku tvojega kluba. Kategorija ni obvezna (npr. Pivo, Kokteli)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guests see this video instead of the poster on your club page, so they can see how it was. Up to 100 MB.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
