        }
      }
    },
    "Help Center": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Center za pomoč"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, how can we help?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Živjo, kako lahko pomagamo?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domov"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home is a feed of what is on. Depending on what is available you will see Suggestions (clubs that match your genres), Tonight or This week, Interested events, Last week's biggest hits, In your area, Friends plans, Big events coming up, This weekend and Discover your genre. Tap any card to open it.\n\nIn your area: tap a club to open it. If you allowed your location, the first tap shows how far away the club is and the second tap opens it.\n\nDiscover your genre lists music genres; tap one to see its upcoming events. Tap See all events at the bottom of Home for a list of every upcoming event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Domov je pregled dogajanja. Glede na ponudbo vidiš Predlogi (klubi, ki ustrezajo tvojim žanrom), Nocoj ali Ta teden, Zanima me, Največji hiti prejšnjega tedna, V tvoji bližini, Načrti prijateljev, Veliki dogodki, ki prihajajo, Ta vikend in Odkrij svoj žanr. Tapni katerokoli kartico, da jo odpreš.\n\nV tvoji bližini: tapni klub, da ga odpreš. Če si dovolil lokacijo, prvi dotik pokaže, kako daleč je klub, drugi ga odpre.\n\nOdkrij svoj žanr našteje glasbene žanre; tapni enega, da vidiš njegove prihajajoče dogodke. Na dnu zavihka Domov tapni Prikaži vse dogodke za seznam vseh prihajajočih dogodkov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hosted": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gostovanje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How payments work": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kako delujejo plačila"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to buy a ticket": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kako kupiti vstopnico"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to use Outly": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kako uporabljati Outly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I confirm the person I'm sending this ticket to is at least %lld years old. They must show a valid photo ID at the door; if they are younger, the club will refuse entry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potrjujem, da je oseba, ki ji pošiljam vstopnico, stara vsaj %lld let. Ob vstopu mora pokazati veljaven osebni dokument s fotografijo; če je mlajša, ji klub vstop zavrne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I organize events without my own venue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organiziram dogodke brez lastnega prizorišča"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'm in": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grem zraven"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app says Set up VIP tables at outly.si/app, the floor plan and prices are set up there. Organizers without their own venue can also do it in the app: open the event, go to VIP tables and choose Use the venue's layout, Own layout for this event or No VIP tables; Edit tables and layout lets you add tables, drag them into place and set seats and price. Save the event first.\n\nTo take a reservation by phone: Dashboard > event > VIP reservations, tap Mark as reserved on a free table, enter the Guest name and a Note, and tap Reserve. Tap Release to free the table again. Only owners and managers can do this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če aplikacija pove, da VIP mize nastaviš na outly.si/app, tloris in cene nastaviš tam. Organizatorji brez lastnega prizorišča to lahko naredijo tudi v aplikaciji: odpri dogodek, pojdi na VIP mize in izberi Uporabi razpored prizorišča, Lasten razpored za ta dogodek ali Brez VIP miz; z Uredi mize in tloris dodaš mize, jih povlečeš na mesto in nastaviš sedeže in ceno. Najprej shrani dogodek.\n\nRezervacijo po telefonu vneseš takole: Pregled > dogodek > VIP rezervacije, pri prosti mizi tapni Označi kot rezervirano, vpiši Ime gosta in Opombo ter tapni Rezerviraj. Tapni Sprosti, da mizo spet sprostiš. To lahko naredita samo lastnik in upravitelj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your friend doesn't have an Outly account, we'll email them the ticket with a QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če tvoj prijatelj nima računa Outly, mu vstopnico s kodo QR pošljemo po e-pošti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IN": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NOTRI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IN %lld DAYS": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ČEZ %lld DNI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the event is cancelled, the refund goes to the original buyer, not to the person you send the ticket to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če je dogodek odpovedan, vračilo dobi prvotni kupec, ne oseba, ki ji pošlješ vstopnico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the event is cancelled, the refund goes to you as the buyer, not to the person you send the ticket to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če je dogodek odpovedan, vračilo dobiš ti kot kupec, ne oseba, ki ji pošlješ vstopnico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If tickets were already sold, the event will be cancelled instead of deleted so buyers keep proof of purchase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če so bile vstopnice že prodane, se dogodek namesto izbrisa prekliče, da kupci obdržijo dokazilo o nakupu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In your area": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V tvoji bližini"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instagram": {
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "Interested": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zanima me"
          }
        }
      }
    },
