          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not added yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Še ni dodano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not enough tickets left.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni dovolj vstopnic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not found.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni najdeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not on the map yet — set the address and city.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Še ni na zemljevidu — nastavi naslov in mesto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni nastavljeno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing found. Try another word or contact us below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nič ni bilo najdeno. Poskusi drugo besedo ali nas kontaktiraj spodaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing left to serve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vse je postreženo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing on yet": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Še nič na sporedu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing to save.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni sprememb za shraniti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obvestila"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications  >  Bell": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obvestila  >  Zvonec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications  >  Push": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obvestila  >  Potisna obvestila"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Number of tickets available. Shows “N left” and “Sold out” to guests.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Število razpoložljivih vstopnic. Gostom prikaže “Še N” in “Razprodano”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V redu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Outly": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na Outlyju"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ORDER": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NAROČILO"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the login screen tap Forgot password and enter your email. We send you a code; enter it together with a new password.\n\nIf you are logged in, go to My Account > Password and security to change your password. This logs you out on all other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zaslonu za prijavo tapni Forgot password (pozabljeno geslo) in vnesi e-pošto. Pošljemo ti kodo; vnesi jo skupaj z novim geslom.\n\nČe si prijavljen(a), pojdi na Moj račun > Geslo in varnost, da spremeniš geslo. To te odjavi na vseh drugih napravah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the map ✓": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zemljevidu ✓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One of the selected genres is not available. Reload and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eden od izbranih žanrov ni na voljo. Osveži in poskusi znova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the club owner can do that.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To lahko naredi samo lastnik kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only your three most popular past events can have a video. This keeps your club page fast to open.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video lahko dobijo samo trije najbolj priljubljeni pretekli dogodki. Tako se stran tvojega kluba hitro odpre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event and tap I'm in next to its title. The button changes to Interested; tap it again to take it back. Once you have a ticket it shows Going.\n\nEvents you are interested in appear on Home under Interested events. Tap See all to open the full list, split into Coming up and Already happened.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in tapni Grem zraven ob naslovu. Gumb se spremeni v Zanima me; tapni ga znova, da ga razveljaviš. Ko imaš vstopnico, piše Grem.\n\nDogodki, ki te zanimajo, so na zavihku Domov pod Zanima me. Tapni Prikaži vse za celoten seznam, razdeljen na Prihaja in Že minilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open My friends to accept": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Moje prijatelje za sprejem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open My team (managers: Profile > My Clubs > your club > Team). Tap Invite member, enter their Outly email, choose a role and tap Send invite. They need an Outly account with that email; the invitation reaches them in the app and they join when they accept.\n\nRoles: Manager — events, sales, club page and door staff; only the owner can add managers. Door staff — scans tickets at the door, nothing else. Bartender — sees VIP tables to serve and marks them delivered, with no guest details.\n\nTo remove someone, or to cancel a pending invitation, tap the x next to the name. A removed person loses access to the club tools right away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri My team (ekipa) (upravitelji: Profil > Moji klubi > tvoj klub > Ekipa). Tapni Povabi člana, vpiši njihov Outly e-poštni naslov, izberi vlogo in tapni Pošlji vabilo. Potrebujejo Outly račun s tem e-poštnim naslovom; vabilo prispe v aplikacijo, ekipi pa se pridružijo, ko ga sprejmejo.\n\nVloge: Upravitelj — dogodki, prodaja, stran kluba in vratarji; upravitelje lahko dodaja samo lastnik. Vratar — skenira vstopnice pri vhodu, nič drugega. Natakar — vidi VIP mize za strežbo in jih označi kot dostavljene, brez podatkov o gostih.\n\nNekoga odstraniš ali čakajoče vabilo prekličeš tako, da tapneš x ob imenu. Odstranjena oseba takoj izgubi dostop do klubskih orodij."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile > My Friends and tap Add friends. Search by username (at least 2 letters) and tap Add next to a person. Requested means the request is waiting; tap it to cancel.\n\nRequests you receive appear at the top of My Friends under Friend requests (and in the bell on Home). Tap Accept or Decline. To remove a friend, open the … menu next to them and choose Remove friend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Moji prijatelji in tapni Dodaj prijatelje. Išči po uporabniškem imenu (vsaj 2 črki) in tapni Dodaj ob osebi. Poslano pomeni, da prošnja čaka; tapni ga, da jo prekličeš.\n\nPrejete prošnje so na vrhu zaslona Moji prijatelji pod Prošnje za prijateljstvo (in pod zvoncem na zavihku Domov). Tapni Sprejmi ali Zavrni. Prijatelja odstraniš tako, da ob njem odpreš meni … in izbereš Odstrani prijatelja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile > Tickets and tap the ticket. Show the QR code to the staff at the entrance — they scan it with Outly.\n\nA ticket can be scanned only once. Screenshots work, but keep your brightness up so the code is readable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Vstopnice in tapni vstopnico. Kodo QR pokaži osebju pri vhodu — skenirajo jo z Outlyjem.\n\nVstopnico je mogoče skenirati samo enkrat. Posnetek zaslona deluje, a naj bo osvetlitev dovolj visoka, da je koda berljiva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile > Tickets. Upcoming tickets are on top and Past below; tickets that were already scanned move to Used tickets. Tap a ticket to open it with its QR code. A VIP table is one group — tap it to open its tickets.\n\nTickets someone sent you and guest list tickets are here too.\n\nNo signal? Tickets keeps the last list it downloaded, so you can still open your QR code at the door.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Vstopnice. Prihajajoče vstopnice so na vrhu, Pretekle pod njimi; že skenirane vstopnice se premaknejo med Uporabljene vstopnice. Tapni vstopnico, da jo odpreš z njeno QR kodo. VIP miza je ena skupina — tapni jo, da odpreš njene vstopnice.\n\nTu so tudi vstopnice, ki ti jih je kdo poslal, in vstopnice s seznama gostov.\n\nBrez signala? Vstopnice ohranijo zadnji prenesen seznam, zato lahko QR kodo pri vhodu še vedno odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri nastavitve"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event and tap the price bar under the poster. Choose how many tickets you want and confirm.\n\nYour tickets appear under Profile > Tickets right away. Each ticket has its own QR code.\n\nEvents marked 18+ require a date of birth in your profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in tapni cenovno vrstico pod plakatom. Izberi, koliko vstopnic želiš, in potrdi.\n\nVstopnice se takoj prikažejo pod Profil > Vstopnice. Vsaka vstopnica ima svojo kodo QR.\n\nDogodki z oznako 18+ zahtevajo datum rojstva v tvojem profilu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event and tap the price on the poster. Choose how many tickets you want with the minus and plus buttons, then tap Pay (it shows the total), or Get ticket if the event is free. If the club takes payments through Stripe, a secure Stripe page opens for the payment and brings you back to Outly.\n\nYour tickets appear under Profile > Tickets as soon as the payment goes through. Each ticket has its own QR code.\n\nIf the poster says at the door, you pay at the club; if it says sold by the club, the button opens the club's own ticket page.\n\nEvents marked 18+ require a date of birth in your profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in tapni ceno na plakatu. Z gumboma minus in plus izberi število vstopnic, nato tapni Plačaj (pokaže skupni znesek) ali Kupi vstopnico, če je dogodek brezplačen. Če klub sprejema plačila prek Stripa, se za plačilo odpre varna Stripova stran, po plačilu pa se vrneš v Outly.\n\nVstopnice se pojavijo pod Profil > Vstopnice, takoj ko plačilo steče. Vsaka vstopnica ima svojo QR kodo.\n\nČe na plakatu piše pri vhodu (at the door), plačaš v klubu; če piše prodaja klub (sold by the club), gumb odpre klubovo stran z vstopnicami.\n\nDogodki z oznako 18+ zahtevajo datum rojstva v tvojem profilu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event from Home, Search, a club page or the Map. At the top is the poster with the ticket price. Below it are the club (tap it to open the club page), the date and time, the address with a small map (tap it for directions), Bar prices, the description (ABOUT) and who is selling the tickets.\n\nIf friends are going or interested, you see them under the title. To report an event, tap the … menu at the top right and choose Report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodek odpri z zavihka Domov, iz Iskanja, s strani kluba ali z Zemljevida. Zgoraj je plakat s ceno vstopnice. Pod njim so klub (tapni ga, da odpreš stran kluba), datum in ura, naslov z majhnim zemljevidom (tapni ga za navodila za pot), Cenik bara, opis (O DOGODKU) in podatek, kdo prodaja vstopnice.\n\nČe prijatelji gredo ali jih zanima, jih vidiš pod naslovom. Dogodek prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Dashboard. Sales shows revenue for a period — choose By year, By month or By week. Below are Total revenue, Tickets sold, Outly fee and Your payout (after fee and refunds).\n\nCheck activity shows clicks on your profile and events and your Followers; Staff activity shows what your team scanned; Event performance lists your events — tap one for Door check-in and VIP reservations, or View all for the full list. While payments are in test mode, a TEST label shows and no money moves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Pregled. Prodaja prikaže prihodek za obdobje — izberi Po letu, Po mesecu ali Po tednu. Spodaj so Skupni prihodek, Prodane vstopnice, Provizija Outly in Tvoje izplačilo (po proviziji in vračilih).\n\nPreveri aktivnost prikaže klike na tvoj profil in dogodke ter Sledilce; Aktivnost ekipe prikaže, kaj je skenirala tvoja ekipa; Uspešnost dogodkov našteje tvoje dogodke — tapni enega za Vstop pri vratih in VIP rezervacije ali Prikaži vse za celoten seznam. Dokler so plačila v testnem načinu, je prikazana oznaka TEST in denar se ne premika."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Events and tap Add event (managers: Profile > My Clubs > your club > Create event). Fill in Title and Description, When (Starts, and Has end time if the event has an end), Who (Minimum age and music genres) and Tickets: Price in EUR (leave it empty if tickets are not sold on Outly, 0 means free entry), Capacity and an optional external ticket link. Choose a poster, switch on Published (visible to everyone) and tap Save.\n\nTap an event in the list to edit it. To remove one, tap Cancel or delete event. If tickets were already sold, the event is cancelled instead of deleted, so buyers keep proof of purchase.\n\nPast events can get an Event video that guests see on your club page — only your three most popular past events qualify.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Dogodki in tapni Dodaj dogodek (upravitelji: Profil > Moji klubi > tvoj klub > Ustvari dogodek). Izpolni Naslov in Opis, Kdaj (Začetek in Ima čas zaključka, če ima dogodek konec), Kdo (Najnižja starost in glasbeni žanri) ter Vstopnice: Cena (EUR) (pusti prazno, če vstopnic ne prodajaš na Outlyju, 0 pomeni brezplačen vstop), Kapaciteta in neobvezna zunanja povezava do vstopnic. Izberi plakat, vklopi Objavljeno (vidno vsem) in tapni Shrani.\n\nTapni dogodek na seznamu, da ga urediš. Dogodek odstraniš z Prekliči ali izbriši dogodek. Če so bile vstopnice že prodane, se dogodek prekliče namesto izbriše, da kupci obdržijo dokazilo o nakupu.\n\nPretekli dogodki lahko dobijo Video dogodka, ki ga gostje vidijo na strani tvojega kluba — to velja samo za tvoje tri najbolj priljubljene pretekle dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the club page": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri stran kluba"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Map tab. Every club on Outly is a pin, and you see yourself too if you allowed your location. Tap a pin to see the club's name and city, then tap the info button (i) next to it to open the club page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri zavihek Zemljevid. Vsak klub na Outlyju je žebljiček, vidiš pa tudi sebe, če si dovolil lokacijo. Tapni žebljiček, da vidiš ime in mesto kluba, nato tapni gumb z informacijami (i) ob njem, da odpreš stran kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Search tab, or tap Where to? on Home. Type at least 2 characters; results are split into Clubs and Events. Tap a result to open it.\n\nBefore you type, Search shows Browse by genre — tap a genre to see its events — and a list of clubs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri zavihek Iskanje ali tapni Kam gremo? na zavihku Domov. Vpiši vsaj 2 znaka; rezultati so razdeljeni na Klubi in Dogodki. Tapni rezultat, da ga odpreš.\n\nPreden začneš tipkati, Iskanje prikaže Prebrskaj po žanru — tapni žanr, da vidiš njegove dogodke — in seznam klubov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open to accept or reject": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri za sprejem ali zavrnitev"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional. Used for account recovery and important notifications. Include the country code, e.g. +386.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neobvezno. Uporabimo ga za obnovitev računa in pomembna obvestila. Vpiši s klicno kodo države, npr. +386."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Order %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naročilo %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organizer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organizator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organizer name": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ime organizatorja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Organizer: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Organizator: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Other": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drugo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outly fee": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Provizija Outly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outly helps you find where to go tonight: clubs, events and tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outly ti pomaga najti, kam nocoj: klube, dogodke in vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owner": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastnik"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owners, managers and bartenders open Profile > My Clubs > your club > Table service (owners switch to their personal profile first). When door staff scan a VIP ticket, the table appears in the list with its package and the time it was scanned. The list refreshes by itself; pull down to refresh it yourself. Choose the event at the top if there is more than one.\n\nTap Delivered once the table has been served. Tapped by mistake? Tap Undo. Staff also get a notification when a table is ready to serve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastniki, upravitelji in natakarji odprejo Profil > Moji klubi > tvoj klub > Strežba miz (lastniki se najprej preklopijo na osebni profil). Ko vratar skenira VIP vstopnico, se miza pojavi na seznamu s paketom in časom skena. Seznam se osvežuje sam; povleci navzdol, če ga želiš osvežiti sam. Zgoraj izberi dogodek, če jih je več.\n\nKo je miza postrežena, tapni Dostavljeno. Po pomoti? Tapni Razveljavi. Osebje dobi tudi obvestilo, ko je miza pripravljena za strežbo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owners, managers and door staff scan with the camera: open Profile > My Clubs, tap your club, then Scan ticket (owners first switch to their personal profile: Settings > Switch to personal account). The scanner opens straight away — you don't pick an event. It covers the club's events from 12 hours before the start until 6 hours after the end. Point the camera at the guest's QR code.\n\nGreen WELCOME IN lets the guest in. Red means no (for example ALREADY SCANNED, REFUNDED, CANCELLED, NOT PAID or INVALID CODE). A gold bar marks a VIP table, a white bar a guest list guest. Tap Next for the following guest.\n\nYellow means the phone can't check the ticket by itself. If you decide to let the guest in, tap Let in; the server checks later and anything wrong appears under Conflicts (triangle, top right). Use the flashlight button in dark rooms.\n\nThe scanner also works without signal: it downloads the ticket list and sends scans when you are back online. Until the list is downloaded, tickets can only be checked with a connection. You can also check guests in by hand: Dashboard > event > Check in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastniki, upravitelji in vratarji skenirajo s kamero: odpri Profil > Moji klubi, tapni svoj klub, nato Skeniraj vstopnico (lastniki se najprej preklopijo na osebni profil: Settings (nastavitve) > Switch to personal account (preklop na osebni račun)). Skener se odpre takoj — dogodka ne izbiraš. Zajame klubove dogodke od 12 ur pred začetkom do 6 ur po koncu. Usmeri kamero v QR kodo gosta.\n\nZeleno DOBRODOŠLI pomeni, da gosta spustiš noter. Rdeče pomeni ne (na primer ŽE SKENIRANO, VRNJENO, PREKLICANO, NEPLAČANO ali NEVELJAVNA KODA). Zlata vrstica označuje VIP mizo, bela gosta s seznama gostov. Tapni Naprej za naslednjega gosta.\n\nRumeno pomeni, da telefon vstopnice ne more preveriti sam. Če se odločiš gosta spustiti, tapni Spusti; strežnik preveri pozneje, vse, kar ni v redu, pa se pokaže pod Konflikti (trikotnik, zgoraj desno). V temnih prostorih uporabi gumb svetilke.\n\nSkener deluje tudi brez signala: prenese seznam vstopnic, skene pa pošlje, ko je spet povezan. Dokler seznam ni prenesen, je vstopnice mogoče preveriti samo s povezavo. Goste lahko prijaviš tudi ročno: Pregled > dogodek > Prijavi vstop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
