            "value": "Dogodek se pokaže tudi na strani tega kluba, vstopnice pa lahko skenira samo tvoja ekipa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time you open the club profile you see Set up your club: add a logo, the name, address and city, minimum age and music genres, then tap Create club. If you organize events without your own venue, switch on I organize events without my own venue — there is then no address or map pin and you choose the venue for each event.\n\nLater tap Edit your page, then Club info (also under Settings) to change details: Club name, Phone number, Website, Instagram, Email, About club, Address, City, Minimum age, Music genres, Slideshow (up to 3 photos), Club video and Bar prices. Under Bar prices tap Add item, enter a name and price (category is optional) and tap Save.\n\nSeller details (company name, registered office, registration number, tax number) and VAT status are shown to buyers before payment. Only the club owner can change them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko prvič odpreš klubski profil, vidiš Set up your club (nastavi svoj klub): dodaj logotip, ime, naslov in mesto, najnižjo starost in glasbene žanre, nato tapni Create club (ustvari klub). Če dogodke organiziraš brez lastnega prizorišča, vklopi Organiziram dogodke brez lastnega prizorišča — takrat ni naslova in oznake na zemljevidu, prizorišče pa izbereš za vsak dogodek posebej.\n\nKasneje tapni Uredi svojo stran, nato Podatki o klubu (tudi pod Settings), da spremeniš podrobnosti: Ime kluba, Telefonska številka, Spletna stran, Instagram, E-pošta, O klubu, Naslov, Mesto, Najnižja starost, Glasbeni žanri, Galerija (do 3 fotografije), Video kluba in Cenik bara. Pod Cenik bara tapni Dodaj postavko, vpiši ime in ceno (kategorija ni obvezna) in tapni Shrani.\n\nPodatki prodajalca (ime podjetja, sedež, matična številka, davčna številka) in Status DDV so kupcem prikazani pred plačilom. Spremeniti jih sme samo lastnik kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The payment was not completed. You can try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plačilo ni bilo dokončano. Poskusi znova."
          }
