            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupci še ne morejo kupovati: v Podatkih o klubu izpolni podatke prodajalca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buyers can't purchase yet: the club owner needs to complete the seller details in Club info.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
