          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap \"Add event\" to publish your first one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni \"Dodaj dogodek\" za objavo prvega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Sign up, enter your username, email and a password. We send a code (6–10 digits) to your email — type it in to confirm your address.\n\nThen complete your profile: date of birth, country and the music you like. Your date of birth is used only to check age limits on events.\n\nYou must be at least 15 to use Outly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Sign up (registracija), vnesi uporabniško ime, e-pošto in geslo. Na e-pošto ti pošljemo kodo (6–10 števk) — vpiši jo, da potrdiš naslov.\n\nNato dokončaj profil: datum rojstva, državo in glasbo, ki jo imaš rad(a). Datum rojstva uporabimo samo za preverjanje starostnih omejitev pri dogodkih.\n\nZa uporabo Outlyja moraš imeti vsaj 15 let."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the heart on any event and it will show up here and on your home screen — on every device you log in to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni srček na katerem koli dogodku in prikazal se bo tukaj ter na domačem zaslonu — na vsaki napravi, v katero se prijaviš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to open": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni za odpiranje"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Team": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ekipa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us about your venue. We usually reply within a few days.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Povej nam nekaj o svojem lokalu. Običajno odgovorimo v nekaj dneh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of Service": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pogoji uporabe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test mode — nothing is charged": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testni način — nič se ne zaračuna"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test mode: purchases are simulated, no money moves. They are counted under Test purchases, not in the totals.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testni način: nakupi so simulirani, denar se ne premika. Šteti so pod Testni nakupi, ne v zneskih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test purchase — nothing was charged": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testni nakup — nič ni bilo zaračunano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test purchases": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testni nakupi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks! We will review it and email you when it is approved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvala! Pregledali jo bomo in ti pisali po e-pošti, ko bo odobrena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That date of birth does not look right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta datum rojstva ni videti pravilen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That email is already registered. Sign in instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta e-naslov je že registriran. Prijavi se."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is your own email.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To je tvoj lastni e-naslov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That phone number is already used by another account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To telefonsko številko že uporablja drug račun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That username is already taken.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To uporabniško ime je že zasedeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That username isn't allowed. Choose another.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To uporabniško ime ni dovoljeno. Izberi drugo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bar at the bottom has four tabs: Home, Search, Map and Profile.\n\nOn Home, tap your picture (top left) to open your Profile and the bell (top right) for notifications. Tap Where to? to search, or the sliders icon next to it to open Filters. Pull down to refresh.\n\nEverything you can do in Outly is explained in the articles below — use the search field on this screen to jump to one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spodnja vrstica ima štiri zavihke: Domov, Iskanje, Zemljevid in Profil.\n\nNa zavihku Domov tapni svojo sliko (zgoraj levo), da odpreš Profil, in zvonec (zgoraj desno) za obvestila. Tapni Kam gremo?, da iščeš, ali ikono drsnikov ob njem, da odpreš Filtre. Povleci navzdol za osvežitev.\n\nVse, kar lahko narediš v Outlyju, je razloženo v spodnjih člankih — z iskalnim poljem na tem zaslonu hitro najdeš pravega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bell on Home": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zvonec na zavihku Domov"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Purchases aren't available yet: the organizer hasn't completed their seller details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nakup še ni mogoč: organizator še ni izpolnil podatkov prodajalca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The QR on each ticket is signed by the server; scanning it twice is refused. Use Scan tickets in your profile for the camera scanner.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "QR kodo vsake vstopnice podpiše strežnik; dvojno skeniranje je zavrnjeno. Za skener s kamero uporabi Skeniraj vstopnice v profilu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code is wrong or has expired. Request a new one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Koda je napačna ali je potekla. Zahtevaj novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is having trouble. Please try again later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strežnik ima trenutno težave. Poskusi znova pozneje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server took too long to respond. Please try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Strežnik se ni odzval pravočasno. Poskusi znova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ticket moves to your friend's account with a new QR code. Your copy stops working. Your friend needs an Outly account and must be %lld+.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnica se prenese na prijateljev račun z novo kodo QR. Tvoja kopija preneha delovati. Prijatelj potrebuje Outly račun in mora biti star %lld+."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ticket moves to your friend's account with a new QR code. Your copy stops working. Your friend needs an Outly account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnica se prenese na prijateljev račun z novo kodo QR. Tvoja kopija preneha delovati. Prijatelj potrebuje Outly račun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video could not be prepared without location data, so it was not uploaded. Please try another video.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Videa ni bilo mogoče pripraviti brez podatkov o lokaciji, zato ni bil naložen. Poskusi z drugim videom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The video is larger than 100 MB. Please pick a shorter one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Video je večji od 100 MB. Izberi krajšega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their Outly email": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Njihov Outly e-poštni naslov"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They lose access to the club tools right away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takoj izgubijo dostop do orodij za klub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They need an Outly account with this email. They get the invitation in the app (Profile → My clubs) and join once they accept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potrebujejo Outly račun s tem e-poštnim naslovom. Vabilo dobijo v aplikaciji (Profil → Moji klubi) in se pridružijo, ko ga sprejmejo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action is permanent. It will remove your account, liked events and personal data. Tickets you have already bought stay valid, but they will no longer be linked to you and cannot be recovered in the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To dejanje je dokončno. Izbrisali bomo tvoj račun, všečkane dogodke in osebne podatke. Že kupljene vstopnice ostanejo veljavne, a ne bodo več povezane s tabo in jih v aplikaciji ne moreš obnoviti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event has already ended.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta dogodek se je že končal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event has already started.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta dogodek se je že začel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event is cancelled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta dogodek je preklican."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event is not on sale.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za ta dogodek prodaja ni odprta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event no longer exists.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta dogodek ne obstaja več."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This includes your club’s phone number used for customer inquiries and support.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
