    "Title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Naslov"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To report an event or a club, tap the … menu at the top right of its page and choose Report. Pick a reason and tap Send. We review reports within 24 hours.\n\nTo report or block a person, open the … menu next to their name (in My Friends or when you search for friends) and choose Report or Block. People you block can't find you or send you requests, and they are not notified. You can undo it under Profile > My Account > Blocked users with Unblock; the friendship does not come back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodek ali klub prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno na njegovi strani tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi. Izberi razlog in tapni Pošlji. Prijave pregledamo v 24 urah.\n\nOsebo prijaviš ali blokiraš tako, da ob njenem imenu (pri Moji prijatelji ali ko iščeš prijatelje) odpreš meni … in izbereš Prijavi ali Blokiraj. Blokirani te ne najdejo in ti ne morejo pošiljati prošenj, o blokadi pa niso obveščeni. Razveljaviš jo pod Profil > Moj račun > Blokirani uporabniki z Odblokiraj; prijateljstvo se ne obnovi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
