    "Waiting for reply": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Čaka na odgovor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We are reviewing your application. You will get an email when it is approved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tvojo prošnjo pregledujemo. Ko bo odobrena, ti pošljemo e-pošto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We sent a code to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kodo smo poslali na %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We sent a verification code to:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kodo za potrditev smo poslali na:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We will reply to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odgovorili bomo na %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're sorry to see you go! This is permanent: your account and personal data will be removed, and tickets you bought will no longer be linked to you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Škoda, da odhajaš! To je dokončno: tvoj račun in osebni podatki bodo izbrisani, kupljene vstopnice pa ne bodo več povezane s tabo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spletna stran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kdaj"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a club invites you to its team, you see it in the bell on Home and in Profile > My Clubs (bell, top right). Open the invitation and tap Accept to join or Reject to decline. The club then shows under My Clubs, with the tools for your role.\n\nTo leave a team, open the club under My Clubs and tap Leave the team. The club can invite you again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko te klub povabi v svojo ekipo, vabilo vidiš pod zvoncem na zavihku Domov in v Profil > Moji klubi (zvonec, zgoraj desno). Odpri vabilo in tapni Sprejmi, da se pridružiš, ali Zavrni. Klub se nato pokaže pod Moji klubi, z orodji za tvojo vlogo.\n\nEkipo zapustiš tako, da pod Moji klubi odpreš klub in tapneš Zapusti ekipo. Klub te lahko znova povabi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a friend gets a ticket, the event shows up here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko prijatelj dobi vstopnico, se dogodek pokaže tukaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, your friends see which events you have a ticket for under “Your friends' plans”. Only friends, never anyone else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko je vklopljeno, prijatelji pod »Načrti prijateljev« vidijo, za katere dogodke imaš vstopnico. Samo prijatelji, nikoli kdo drug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where to find your tickets": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kje najdeš svoje vstopnice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where to?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
