    },
    "This is not a valid Outly ticket.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To ni veljavna vstopnica Outly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OLD CODE": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "STARA KODA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On an event page scroll to VIP & TABLES and tap Reserve a VIP table. If the club has published a table layout you see the floor plan; if not, call the club on the number shown under the card.\n\nTap a free table, choose your bottle if the club offers packages (it is included in the table price) and tap Reserve table. If you pay through Stripe, the table is held for you until you finish paying.\n\nAfterwards you can send tickets to your friends: choose them from the list and tap Send to friends, or tap Skip — tickets you don't send stay under Tickets.\n\nLike tickets, a VIP table for a dated event cannot be returned after purchase. The seller is the club; Outly is the intermediary.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na strani dogodka se pomakni do VIP IN MIZE in tapni Rezerviraj VIP mizo. Če je klub objavil razpored miz, vidiš tloris; če ne, pokliči klub na številko, ki je prikazana pod kartico.\n\nTapni prosto mizo, izberi svojo steklenico, če klub ponuja pakete (vključena je v ceno mize), in tapni Rezerviraj mizo. Če plačaš prek Stripa, je miza zate zadržana, dokler ne končaš plačila.\n\nNato lahko vstopnice pošlješ prijateljem: izberi jih s seznama in tapni Pošlji prijateljem ali tapni Preskoči — vstopnice, ki jih ne pošlješ, ostanejo pod Vstopnice.\n\nTako kot vstopnice tudi VIP mize za dogodek z datumom po nakupu ni mogoče vrniti. Prodajalec je klub; Outly je posrednik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On an event page tap Bar prices to open the club's drink list, grouped by category. Prices are set by the club and may change.\n\nIf it says Not added yet, the club has not shared its prices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na strani dogodka tapni Cenik bara, da odpreš klubov seznam pijač, razvrščen po kategorijah. Cene določi klub in se lahko spremenijo.\n\nČe piše Še ni dodano, klub svojih cen še ni delil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Home tap the sliders icon next to Where to?. Choose a City, tick Music genres and move the sliders for Distance, Age range and Entry price. Tap Apply filters.\n\nA blue dot on the icon means filters are on. Tap Reset to clear them.\n\nTurn on Use my preferences to fill in the filters from Profile > My Account > Preferences > My preferences.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zavihku Domov tapni ikono drsnikov ob Kam gremo?. Izberi Mesto, označi Glasbeni žanri in premakni drsnike za Razdalja, Starost in Cena vstopnice. Tapni Uporabi filtre.\n\nModra pika na ikoni pomeni, da so filtri vklopljeni. Tapni Ponastavi, da jih počistiš.\n\nVklopi Uporabi moje nastavitve, da se filtri izpolnijo iz Profil > Moj račun > Nastavitve > Moje nastavitve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Home, Friends plans shows your friends as circles: a blue ring means they have a ticket, a white ring means they are interested. Tap View to see their events, then Join them to buy a ticket for the same event or View event to open it. Tap Invite more to share Outly with someone who isn't on it yet.\n\nYour friends can see your plans too. To switch that off, go to Profile > My Account > Preferences and turn off Friends can see my plans.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zavihku Domov Načrti prijateljev prikažejo prijatelje kot kroge: moder rob pomeni, da imajo vstopnico, bel rob, da jih dogodek zanima. Tapni Prikaži, da vidiš njihove dogodke, nato Pridruži se, da kupiš vstopnico za isti dogodek, ali Poglej dogodek, da ga odpreš. Tapni Povabi še koga, da Outly deliš z nekom, ki ga še nima.\n\nTudi prijatelji vidijo tvoje načrte. Če tega ne želiš, odpri Profil > Moj račun > Nastavitve in izklopi Prijatelji vidijo moje načrte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This ticket has an old code. It can only be checked with a connection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
