          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Odkrij svoj žanr tapni žanr, da vidiš njegove prihajajoče dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap See all events at the bottom of Home to see every upcoming event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na dnu zavihka Domov tapni Prikaži vse dogodke za seznam vseh prihajajočih dogodkov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Depending on what is available you will see Suggestions (clubs that match your genres), Tonight or This week, Interested events, Last week's biggest hits, In your area, Friends plans, Big events coming up, This weekend and Discover your genre.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glede na ponudbo vidiš Predlogi (klubi, ki ustrezajo tvojim žanrom), Nocoj ali Ta teden, Zanima me, Največji hiti prejšnjega tedna, V tvoji bližini, Načrti prijateljev, Veliki dogodki, ki prihajajo, Ta vikend in Odkrij svoj žanr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you allowed your location, the first tap on a club under In your area shows how far away it is and the second tap opens it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če si dovolil lokacijo, prvi dotik na klub pod V tvoji bližini pokaže, kako daleč je, drugi ga odpre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find clubs and events by name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poišči klube in dogodke po imenu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Search tab, or tap Where to? on Home.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri zavihek Iskanje ali tapni Kam gremo? na zavihku Domov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look through the results, split into Clubs and Events.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej rezultate, razdeljene na Klubi in Dogodki."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a result to open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni rezultat, da ga odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you type, Search shows Browse by genre — tap a genre to see its events — and a list of clubs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preden začneš tipkati, Iskanje prikaže Prebrskaj po žanru — tapni žanr, da vidiš njegove dogodke — in seznam klubov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Narrow down events by city, music genre, distance, age and price.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoži izbiro dogodkov po mestu, glasbenem žanru, razdalji, starosti in ceni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the sliders icon next to Where to?.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
