          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mark events you like, so you find them again on Home.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Označi dogodke, ki ti ugajajo, da jih na zavihku Domov najdeš znova."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap I'm in next to its title. The button changes to Interested.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Grem zraven ob naslovu. Gumb se spremeni v Zanima me."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap it again to take it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni ga znova, da ga razveljaviš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once you have a ticket it shows Going.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko imaš vstopnico, piše Grem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Events you are interested in appear on Home under Interested events. Tap See all to open the full list, split into Coming up and Already happened.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodki, ki te zanimajo, so na zavihku Domov pod Zanima me. Tapni Prikaži vse za celoten seznam, razdeljen na Prihaja in Že minilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick tour of what you can see and tap on an event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kratek ogled vsega, kar je na dogodku vidno in tapljivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event from Home, Search, a club page or the Map.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodek odpri z zavihka Domov, iz Iskanja, s strani kluba ali z Zemljevida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the poster at the top: it shows the ticket price.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zgoraj poglej plakat: pokaže ceno vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Below it find the club, the date and time, and the address with a small map.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod njim so klub, datum in ura ter naslov z majhnim zemljevidom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the club to open its page, or the small map for directions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni klub, da odpreš njegovo stran, ali majhen zemljevid za navodila za pot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Bar prices to see drinks, and read the description under ABOUT.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Cenik bara za pijače in preberi opis pod O DOGODKU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The event page also shows who is selling the tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na strani dogodka je tudi podatek, kdo prodaja vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If friends are going or interested, you see them under the title.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če prijatelji gredo ali jih zanima, jih vidiš pod naslovom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To report an event, tap the … menu at the top right and choose Report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodek prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See a club's events and details, and follow it to hear about new events.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej klubove dogodke in podatke ter mu sledi, da izveš za nove dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a club from Search, the Map or an event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri klub iz Iskanja, z Zemljevida ali z dogodka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scroll through its events, the map with the address and Contact.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preglej njegove dogodke, zemljevid z naslovom in Kontakt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap an event to open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni dogodek, da ga odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Follow to get a notification when the club posts a new event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Sledi, da dobiš obvestilo, ko klub objavi nov dogodek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Following to stop.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Sledim, da nehaš slediti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A club page has photos, the city, music genres and minimum age, then Popular and Coming Soon events, a map with the address, Contact (email, phone, Instagram, website) and a description.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stran kluba ima fotografije, mesto, glasbene žanre in najnižjo starost, nato dogodke Priljubljeno in Kmalu na sporedu, zemljevid z naslovom, Kontakt (e-pošta, telefon, Instagram, spletna stran) in opis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow notifications when Outly asks, or turn them on under Preferences.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dovoli obvestila, ko te Outly vpraša, ali jih vklopi pod Nastavitve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To report a club, tap the … menu at the top right and choose Report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klub prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look up the club's drink prices before you go.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej cene pijač v klubu, še preden greš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Bar prices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Cenik bara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Browse the club's drink list, grouped by category.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Preglej klubov seznam pijač, razvrščen po kategorijah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it says Not added yet, the club has not shared its prices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če piše Še ni dodano, klub svojih cen še ni delil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reserve a table at an event that offers VIP tables.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rezerviraj mizo na dogodku, ki ponuja VIP mize."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On an event page, scroll to VIP & TABLES.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na strani dogodka se pomakni do VIP IN MIZE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Reserve a VIP table.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Rezerviraj VIP mizo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a free table.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni prosto mizo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose your bottle, if the club offers packages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi svojo steklenico, če klub ponuja pakete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Reserve table.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Rezerviraj mizo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To send tickets to friends, choose them from the list and tap Send to friends, or tap Skip.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za pošiljanje vstopnic prijateljem jih izberi s seznama in tapni Pošlji prijateljem ali tapni Preskoči."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the club has published a table layout you see the floor plan; if not, call the club on the number shown under the card.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če je klub objavil razpored miz, vidiš tloris; če ne, pokliči klub na številko, ki je prikazana pod kartico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottle is included in the table price.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steklenica je vključena v ceno mize."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you pay through Stripe, the table is held for you until you finish paying.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če plačaš prek Stripa, je miza zate zadržana, dokler ne končaš plačila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets you don't send stay under Tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice, ki jih ne pošlješ, ostanejo pod Vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Like tickets, a VIP table for a dated event cannot be returned after purchase. The seller is the club; Outly is the intermediary.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tako kot vstopnice tudi VIP mize za dogodek z datumom po nakupu ni mogoče vrniti. Prodajalec je klub; Outly je posrednik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outly is for people aged 15 and over, and some events have a higher age limit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Outly je za osebe, stare 15 let ali več, nekateri dogodki pa imajo višjo starostno mejo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find the Date of birth card.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poišči kartico Datum rojstva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Edit and enter your date of birth.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Uredi in vnesi svoj datum rojstva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You must be 15 or older to use Outly. Some events are 18+ — this is shown on the event and you need a date of birth in your profile to buy tickets for them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za uporabo Outlyja moraš imeti vsaj 15 let. Nekateri dogodki so 18+ — to je označeno pri dogodku, za nakup vstopnic pa potrebuješ datum rojstva v profilu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The club may ask for an ID at the door.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klub lahko pri vhodu zahteva osebni dokument."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Buy tickets for an event and find them under Tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kupi vstopnice za dogodek in jih najdi pod Vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open an event and tap the price on the poster.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in tapni ceno na plakatu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose how many tickets you want with the minus and plus buttons.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z gumboma minus in plus izberi število vstopnic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Pay (it shows the total), or Get ticket if the event is free.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Plačaj (pokaže skupni znesek) ali Kupi vstopnico, če je dogodek brezplačen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a secure Stripe page opens, pay there. It brings you back to Outly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če se odpre varna Stripova stran, plačaj tam. Po plačilu se vrneš v Outly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Profile > Tickets to see your tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Profil > Vstopnice, da vidiš svoje vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tickets appear under Profile > Tickets as soon as the payment goes through. Each ticket has its own QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice se pojavijo pod Profil > Vstopnice, takoj ko plačilo steče. Vsaka vstopnica ima svojo QR kodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the poster says at the door, you pay at the club; if it says sold by the club, the button opens the club's own ticket page.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če na plakatu piše pri vhodu (at the door), plačaš v klubu; če piše prodaja klub (sold by the club), gumb odpre klubovo stran z vstopnicami."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Events marked 18+ require a date of birth in your profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodki z oznako 18+ zahtevajo datum rojstva v tvojem profilu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All your tickets are in one place, each with its own QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vse tvoje vstopnice so na enem mestu, vsaka s svojo QR kodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for upcoming tickets on top and Past below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prihajajoče vstopnice so na vrhu, Pretekle pod njimi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a ticket to open it with its QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni vstopnico, da jo odpreš z njeno QR kodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a VIP table, tap the group to open its tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pri VIP mizi tapni skupino, da odpreš njene vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets that were already scanned move to Used tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Že skenirane vstopnice se premaknejo med Uporabljene vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets someone sent you and guest list tickets are here too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu so tudi vstopnice, ki ti jih je kdo poslal, in vstopnice s seznama gostov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No signal? Tickets keeps the last list it downloaded, so you can still open your QR code at the door.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brez signala? Vstopnice ohranijo zadnji prenesen seznam, zato lahko QR kodo pri vhodu še vedno odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show your QR code at the entrance and the staff scan it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pokaži QR kodo pri vhodu in osebje jo skenira."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the ticket.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni vstopnico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show the QR code to the staff at the entrance. They scan it with Outly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kodo QR pokaži osebju pri vhodu — skenirajo jo z Outlyjem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ticket can be scanned only once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnico je mogoče skenirati samo enkrat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots work, but keep your brightness up so the code is readable.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Posnetek zaslona deluje, a naj bo osvetlitev dovolj visoka, da je koda berljiva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give a ticket to a friend. It moves to their account with a new QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podari vstopnico prijatelju. Preide na njegov račun z novo QR kodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the ticket you want to send.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri vstopnico, ki jo želiš poslati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send to a friend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Pošlji prijatelju."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a friend from your list, or tap Send by email instead and enter their email.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi prijatelja s seznama ali tapni Raje pošlji po e-pošti in vpiši njegov e-poštni naslov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send ticket and confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Pošlji vstopnico in potrdi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ticket moves to their account with a new QR code — your old code stops working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnica preide na njegov račun z novo QR kodo — tvoja stara koda preneha veljati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friend needs an Outly account with a confirmed email and must meet the event's age limit. (Where the screen says we'll email them the ticket, a friend without an account can get it by email too.) For events with an age limit you confirm that your friend is old enough.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijatelj potrebuje Outly račun s potrjeno e-pošto in mora izpolnjevati starostno mejo dogodka. (Kjer zaslon pove, da mu vstopnico pošljemo po e-pošti, jo lahko prejme po e-pošti tudi prijatelj brez računa.) Pri dogodkih s starostno mejo potrdiš, da je prijatelj dovolj star."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets can be sent until the event starts. Guest list tickets can't be sent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice lahko pošlješ do začetka dogodka. Vstopnic s seznama gostov ni mogoče pošiljati naprej."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invite friends to an event from your own guest list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Povabi prijatelje na dogodek s svojega seznama gostov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the guest list.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri seznam gostov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Invite friends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Povabi prijatelje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose friends from your list and confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi prijatelje s seznama in potrdi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To free a spot, tap the x next to a friend before they have entered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mesto sprostiš tako, da tapneš x ob prijatelju, preden je vstopil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A guest list is set up by Outly for an event, with you as the host and a set number of spots. You get your own ticket with a QR code under Tickets.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seznam gostov za dogodek nastavi Outly; ti si gostitelj z določenim številom mest. Svojo vstopnico s QR kodo dobiš pod Vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each friend gets their own ticket with their own QR code and can arrive separately.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vsak prijatelj dobi svojo vstopnico s svojo QR kodo in lahko pride ločeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you free a spot, that friend's ticket stops working.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko mesto sprostiš, prijateljeva vstopnica preneha veljati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If a friend adds you to their guest list, you get a notification and the ticket appears under Tickets as Invited by @name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če te prijatelj doda na svoj seznam gostov, dobiš obvestilo, vstopnica pa se pod Vstopnice pokaže kot Povabil te je @ime."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How refunds work for tickets and cancelled events.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kako delujejo vračila za vstopnice in odpovedane dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets are sold by the club; Outly is the marketplace. Because a ticket is for a specific date, there is no 14-day right of withdrawal after purchase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice prodaja klub; Outly je tržnica. Ker je vstopnica vezana na določen datum, po nakupu ni 14-dnevne pravice do odstopa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the club cancels an event, you are entitled to a refund from the club, to your original payment method.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če klub odpove dogodek, imaš pravico do vračila denarja s strani kluba na izvirni način plačila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For anything else, contact the club or write to luka@outly.si with your ticket number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za vse ostalo se obrni na klub ali piši na luka@outly.si s številko svoje vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find people by username, send requests and answer the ones you receive.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poišči osebe po uporabniškem imenu, pošlji prošnje in odgovori na prejete."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Add friends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Dodaj prijatelje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search by username (at least 2 letters).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Išči po uporabniškem imenu (vsaj 2 črki)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Add next to a person.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Dodaj ob osebi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To answer a request, find it under Friend requests at the top and tap Accept or Decline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za odgovor na prošnjo jo poišči pod Prošnje za prijateljstvo na vrhu in tapni Sprejmi ali Zavrni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To remove a friend, open the … menu next to them and choose Remove friend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijatelja odstraniš tako, da ob njem odpreš meni … in izbereš Odstrani prijatelja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requested means the request is waiting; tap it to cancel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poslano pomeni, da prošnja čaka; tapni ga, da jo prekličeš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests you receive also appear in the bell on Home.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prejete prošnje so tudi pod zvoncem na zavihku Domov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See which events your friends are going to or are interested in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej, na katere dogodke gredo prijatelji ali jih zanimajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On Home, find Friends plans.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zavihku Domov poišči Načrti prijateljev."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap View to see a friend's events.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Prikaži, da vidiš prijateljeve dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Join them to buy a ticket for the same event, or View event to open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Pridruži se, da kupiš vstopnico za isti dogodek, ali Poglej dogodek, da ga odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Invite more to share Outly with someone who isn't on it yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Povabi še koga, da Outly deliš z nekom, ki ga še nima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends are shown as circles: a blue ring means they have a ticket, a white ring means they are interested.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijatelji so prikazani kot krogi: moder rob pomeni, da imajo vstopnico, bel rob, da jih dogodek zanima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your friends can see your plans too. To switch that off, go to Profile > My Account > Preferences and turn off Friends can see my plans.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tudi prijatelji vidijo tvoje načrte. Če tega ne želiš, odpri Profil > Moj račun > Nastavitve in izklopi Prijatelji vidijo moje načrte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bell shows what is new for you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zvonec pokaže, kaj je zate novega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the bell at the top right of Home.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni zvonec zgoraj desno na zavihku Domov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap an item to open it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni vnos, da ga odpreš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You see invitations to join a club team, friend requests, a ticket a friend sent you, guest list invitations, new events from clubs you follow and, for club staff, VIP tables ready to serve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vidiš vabila v klubsko ekipo, prošnje za prijateljstvo, vstopnico, ki ti jo je poslal prijatelj, vabila na seznam gostov, nove dogodke klubov, katerim slediš, in — za osebje kluba — VIP mize, ki so pripravljene za strežbo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A number on the bell means something is waiting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Številka na zvoncu pomeni, da nekaj čaka."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get a push notification when something needs your attention.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dobi potisno obvestilo, ko nekaj zahteva tvojo pozornost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Notifications under Preferences.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Obvestila pod Nastavitve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Turn on notifications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Vklopi obvestila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You get a notification for a ticket someone sent you, new events from clubs you follow, an invitation to a guest list and, for club staff, table service requests.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obvestilo dobiš za vstopnico, ki ti jo je kdo poslal, nove dogodke klubov, katerim slediš, vabilo na seznam gostov in — za osebje kluba — zahteve za strežbo miz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you said no earlier, turn them on in iOS Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če si prej rekel(-a) ne, jih vklopi v nastavitvah iOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Report an event, a club or a person, or block someone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijavi dogodek, klub ali osebo, ali koga blokiraj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To report an event or a club, tap the … menu at the top right of its page and choose Report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dogodek ali klub prijaviš tako, da zgoraj desno na njegovi strani tapneš meni … in izbereš Prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a reason and tap Send.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi razlog in tapni Pošlji."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To report or block a person, open the … menu next to their name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osebo prijaviš ali blokiraš tako, da ob njenem imenu odpreš meni …."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Report or Block.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi Prijavi ali Blokiraj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You find the person's … menu in My Friends and when you search for friends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meni … ob osebi najdeš pri Moji prijatelji in ko iščeš prijatelje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We review reports within 24 hours.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijave pregledamo v 24 urah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "People you block can't find you or send you requests, and they are not notified.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blokirani te ne najdejo in ti ne morejo pošiljati prošenj, o blokadi pa niso obveščeni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can undo a block under Profile > My Account > Blocked users with Unblock; the friendship does not come back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blokado razveljaviš pod Profil > Moj račun > Blokirani uporabniki z Odblokiraj; prijateljstvo se ne obnovi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get back into your account with a code we send to your email.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vrni se v račun s kodo, ki ti jo pošljemo na e-pošto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the login screen, tap Forgot password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na zaslonu za prijavo tapni Forgot password (pozabljeno geslo)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter your email.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vnesi e-pošto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the code we send you, together with a new password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vnesi kodo, ki ti jo pošljemo, skupaj z novim geslom."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you are logged in, go to My Account > Password and security to change your password. This logs you out on all other devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če si prijavljen(a), pojdi na Moj račun > Geslo in varnost, da spremeniš geslo. To te odjavi na vseh drugih napravah."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change your password, or sign out of all your devices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spremeni geslo ali se odjavi z vseh naprav."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Login, tap Edit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Prijava tapni Uredi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter your current password and the new one twice.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vpiši trenutno geslo in dvakrat novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Done.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Končano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To sign out of all devices, tap Sign out under Sessions and confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Za odjavo z vseh naprav pod Seje tapni Odjava in potrdi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you change your password, other devices are signed out; this one stays signed in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko spremeniš geslo, se druge naprave odjavijo, ta ostane prijavljena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out under Sessions signs you out of all devices, including this one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odjava pod Seje te odjavi z vseh naprav, tudi s te."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To log out of this device only, tap Log out at the bottom of Profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če se želiš odjaviti samo s te naprave, tapni Odjava na dnu zavihka Profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change your photo, username, phone number, date of birth and country.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spremeni fotografijo, uporabniško ime, telefonsko številko, datum rojstva in državo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the picture with the + to add or change your profile photo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni sliko s plusom, da dodaš ali zamenjaš profilno fotografijo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a card — Username, Phone number, Date of birth or Country — tap Edit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na kartici — Uporabniško ime, Telefonska številka, Datum rojstva ali Država — tapni Uredi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your username needs 3–20 characters: letters, numbers and underscore.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uporabniško ime mora imeti 3–20 znakov: črke, števke in podčrtaj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your email can't be changed in the app; to change it, write to luka@outly.si.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E-pošte v aplikaciji ni mogoče spremeniti; če jo želiš spremeniti, piši na luka@outly.si."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set your favourites, the app language, notifications and who sees your plans.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nastavi svoje priljubljene, jezik aplikacije, obvestila in kdo vidi tvoje načrte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap My preferences to save your favourite music genres, maximum distance, age range and ticket price range.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Moje nastavitve, da shraniš najljubše glasbene žanre, največjo razdaljo, starostni razpon in razpon cene vstopnice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Language to switch between English and Slovenščina.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Jezik, da preklopiš med English in Slovenščina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Notifications to turn on push notifications.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Obvestila, da vklopiš potisna obvestila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Friends can see my plans on or off.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vklopi ali izklopi Prijatelji vidijo moje načrte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My preferences are saved on this phone. Switch on Use my preferences in Filters to apply them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moje nastavitve so shranjene na tem telefonu. Vklopi Uporabi moje nastavitve v Filtrih, da se uporabijo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language switches straight away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jezik se preklopi takoj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends can see my plans decides whether your friends see which events you are going to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prijatelji vidijo moje načrte določa, ali prijatelji vidijo, na katere dogodke greš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets are paid at checkout, through Stripe.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice plačaš ob nakupu, prek Stripa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tickets are paid at checkout.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vstopnice plačaš ob nakupu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Payments are processed by Stripe; Outly never sees or stores your card details, and the app does not hold a balance.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plačila obdeluje Stripe; Outly nikoli ne vidi in ne shranjuje podatkov tvoje kartice, aplikacija pa ne vodi stanja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can read this any time under Profile > Payment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To lahko kadar koli prebereš pod Profil > Plačilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permanently delete your account and personal data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trajno izbriši svoj račun in osebne podatke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Delete Account and confirm.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Izbriši račun in potrdi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your personal data is removed; records of past purchases are kept anonymised, as required for accounting.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tvoji osebni podatki bodo izbrisani; zapisi preteklih nakupov ostanejo anonimizirani, kot to zahteva računovodstvo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valid tickets on a deleted account cannot be recovered, so use them or send them to a friend first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Veljavnih vstopnic na izbrisanem računu ni mogoče obnoviti, zato jih najprej uporabi ali pošlji prijatelju."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply for a club account and, once approved, manage your club in Outly.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zaprosi za klubski račun in po odobritvi upravljaj svoj klub v Outlyju."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill in the short form.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izpolni kratek obrazec."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the status of your request on the same screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stanje prošnje spremljaj na istem zaslonu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once approved, your profile switches to the business view. If it does not, log out and log in again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko je prošnja odobrena, se tvoj profil preklopi na poslovni pogled. Če se ne, se odjavi in znova prijavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We review requests by hand.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prošnje pregledamo ročno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The business view has Edit your page, Dashboard, Events, My team and Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poslovni pogled ima Uredi svojo stran, Pregled, Dogodki, My team (ekipa) in Settings (nastavitve)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning tickets is under Profile > My Clubs — see Scan tickets at the door.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skeniranje vstopnic je pod Profil > Moji klubi — glej Skeniranje vstopnic pri vhodu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owners can switch between the club and the personal profile: Settings > Switch to personal account, and back with My Account > Switch to club account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastnik lahko preklaplja med klubskim in osebnim profilom: Settings (nastavitve) > Switch to personal account (preklop na osebni račun), nazaj pa z Moj račun > Switch to club account (preklop na klubski račun)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your logo and details so guests can find your club.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dodaj logotip in podatke, da gostje najdejo tvoj klub."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Set up your club, add a logo, the name, address and city, minimum age and music genres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Set up your club (nastavi svoj klub) dodaj logotip, ime, naslov in mesto, najnižjo starost in glasbene žanre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Create club.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Create club (ustvari klub)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Later, tap Edit your page, then Club info, to change details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kasneje tapni Uredi svojo stran, nato Podatki o klubu, da spremeniš podrobnosti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Bar prices, tap Add item.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Cenik bara tapni Dodaj postavko."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter a name and price (category is optional) and tap Save.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vpiši ime in ceno (kategorija ni obvezna) in tapni Shrani."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You see Set up your club the first time you open the club profile.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up your club (nastavi svoj klub) vidiš, ko prvič odpreš klubski profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you organize events without your own venue, switch on I organize events without my own venue — there is then no address or map pin and you choose the venue for each event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če dogodke organiziraš brez lastnega prizorišča, vklopi Organiziram dogodke brez lastnega prizorišča — takrat ni naslova in oznake na zemljevidu, prizorišče pa izbereš za vsak dogodek posebej."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Club info (also under Settings) covers: Club name, Phone number, Website, Instagram, Email, About club, Address, City, Minimum age, Music genres, Slideshow (up to 3 photos), Club video and Bar prices.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podatki o klubu (tudi pod Settings) obsegajo: Ime kluba, Telefonska številka, Spletna stran, Instagram, E-pošta, O klubu, Naslov, Mesto, Najnižja starost, Glasbeni žanri, Galerija (do 3 fotografije), Video kluba in Cenik bara."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seller details (company name, registered office, registration number, tax number) and VAT status are shown to buyers before payment. Only the club owner can change them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Podatki prodajalca (ime podjetja, sedež, matična številka, davčna številka) in Status DDV so kupcem prikazani pred plačilom. Spremeniti jih sme samo lastnik kluba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Publish an event with tickets, and change or cancel it later.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objavi dogodek z vstopnicami, pozneje pa ga spremeni ali prekliči."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Events and tap Add event (managers: Profile > My Clubs > your club > Create event).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri Dogodki in tapni Dodaj dogodek (upravitelji: Profil > Moji klubi > tvoj klub > Ustvari dogodek)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill in Title and Description.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izpolni Naslov in Opis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under When, set Starts, and Has end time if the event has an end.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Kdaj nastavi Začetek in Ima čas zaključka, če ima dogodek konec."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Who, set Minimum age and music genres.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Kdo nastavi Najnižja starost in glasbene žanre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Tickets, set Price in EUR, Capacity and an optional external ticket link.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Vstopnice nastavi Cena (EUR), Kapaciteta in neobvezno zunanjo povezavo do vstopnic."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a poster, switch on Published (visible to everyone) and tap Save.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi plakat, vklopi Objavljeno (vidno vsem) in tapni Shrani."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave Price empty if tickets are not sold on Outly; 0 means free entry.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pusti Cena prazno, če vstopnic ne prodajaš na Outlyju; 0 pomeni brezplačen vstop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap an event in the list to edit it. To remove one, tap Cancel or delete event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni dogodek na seznamu, da ga urediš. Dogodek odstraniš z Prekliči ali izbriši dogodek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If tickets were already sold, the event is cancelled instead of deleted, so buyers keep proof of purchase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če so bile vstopnice že prodane, se dogodek prekliče namesto izbriše, da kupci obdržijo dokazilo o nakupu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Past events can get an Event video that guests see on your club page — only your three most popular past events qualify.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pretekli dogodki lahko dobijo Video dogodka, ki ga gostje vidijo na strani tvojega kluba — to velja samo za tvoje tri najbolj priljubljene pretekle dogodke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See your sales, payout, followers and how each event is doing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej prodajo, izplačilo, sledilce in kako gre vsakemu dogodku."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Sales, choose By year, By month or By week.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Prodaja izberi Po letu, Po mesecu ali Po tednu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read Total revenue, Tickets sold, Outly fee and Your payout below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spodaj preberi Skupni prihodek, Prodane vstopnice, Provizija Outly in Tvoje izplačilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Check activity for clicks on your profile and events, and your Followers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Preveri aktivnost vidiš klike na svoj profil in dogodke ter Sledilce."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under Event performance, tap an event for Door check-in and VIP reservations, or tap View all.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pod Uspešnost dogodkov tapni dogodek za Vstop pri vratih in VIP rezervacije ali tapni Prikaži vse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sales shows revenue for the period you choose. Your payout is what is left after fee and refunds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prodaja prikaže prihodek za izbrano obdobje. Tvoje izplačilo je ostanek po proviziji in vračilih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Staff activity shows what your team scanned.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aktivnost ekipe prikaže, kaj je skenirala tvoja ekipa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While payments are in test mode, a TEST label shows and no money moves.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dokler so plačila v testnem načinu, je prikazana oznaka TEST in denar se ne premika."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan guests' QR codes with the camera and let them in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skeniraj QR kode gostov s kamero in jih spusti noter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap your club, then Scan ticket.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni svoj klub, nato Skeniraj vstopnico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Point the camera at the guest's QR code.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Usmeri kamero v QR kodo gosta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Green WELCOME IN means you let the guest in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeleno DOBRODOŠLI pomeni, da gosta spustiš noter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red means no. Do not let the guest in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rdeče pomeni ne. Gosta ne spustiš noter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Next for the following guest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Naprej za naslednjega gosta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owners, managers and door staff scan with the camera. Owners first switch to their personal profile: Settings > Switch to personal account.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastniki, upravitelji in vratarji skenirajo s kamero. Lastniki se najprej preklopijo na osebni profil: Settings (nastavitve) > Switch to personal account (preklop na osebni račun)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanner opens straight away — you don't pick an event. It covers the club's events from 12 hours before the start until 6 hours after the end.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skener se odpre takoj — dogodka ne izbiraš. Zajame klubove dogodke od 12 ur pred začetkom do 6 ur po koncu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red is for example ALREADY SCANNED, REFUNDED, CANCELLED, NOT PAID or INVALID CODE. A gold bar marks a VIP table, a white bar a guest list guest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rdeče je na primer ŽE SKENIRANO, VRNJENO, PREKLICANO, NEPLAČANO ali NEVELJAVNA KODA. Zlata vrstica označuje VIP mizo, bela gosta s seznama gostov."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow means the phone can't check the ticket by itself. If you decide to let the guest in, tap Let in; the server checks later and anything wrong appears under Conflicts (triangle, top right).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rumeno pomeni, da telefon vstopnice ne more preveriti sam. Če se odločiš gosta spustiti, tapni Spusti; strežnik preveri pozneje, vse, kar ni v redu, pa se pokaže pod Konflikti (trikotnik, zgoraj desno)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the flashlight button in dark rooms.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "V temnih prostorih uporabi gumb svetilke."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The scanner also works without signal: it downloads the ticket list and sends scans when you are back online. Until the list is downloaded, tickets can only be checked with a connection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skener deluje tudi brez signala: prenese seznam vstopnic, skene pa pošlje, ko je spet povezan. Dokler seznam ni prenesen, je vstopnice mogoče preveriti samo s povezavo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also check guests in by hand: Dashboard > event > Check in.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Goste lahko prijaviš tudi ročno: Pregled > dogodek > Prijavi vstop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invite people to your club's team and choose what each can do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Povabi ljudi v klubsko ekipo in izberi, kaj lahko kdo dela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open My team (managers: Profile > My Clubs > your club > Team).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri My team (ekipa) (upravitelji: Profil > Moji klubi > tvoj klub > Ekipa)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Invite member.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Povabi člana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter their Outly email and choose a role.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vpiši njihov Outly e-poštni naslov in izberi vlogo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send invite.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Pošlji vabilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To remove someone, or cancel a pending invitation, tap the x next to the name.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nekoga odstraniš ali čakajoče vabilo prekličeš tako, da tapneš x ob imenu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They need an Outly account with that email; the invitation reaches them in the app and they join when they accept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Potrebujejo Outly račun s tem e-poštnim naslovom; vabilo prispe v aplikacijo, ekipi pa se pridružijo, ko ga sprejmejo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manager — events, sales, club page and door staff; only the owner can add managers.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upravitelj — dogodki, prodaja, stran kluba in vratarji; upravitelje lahko dodaja samo lastnik."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Door staff — scans tickets at the door, nothing else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vratar — skenira vstopnice pri vhodu, nič drugega."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bartender — sees VIP tables to serve and marks them delivered, with no guest details.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Natakar — vidi VIP mize za strežbo in jih označi kot dostavljene, brez podatkov o gostih."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A removed person loses access to the club tools right away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odstranjena oseba takoj izgubi dostop do klubskih orodij."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My team": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My team"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Join a club's team by accepting its invitation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pridruži se klubski ekipi s sprejetjem vabila."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find the invitation in the bell on Home, or in My Clubs (bell, top right).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poišči vabilo pod zvoncem na zavihku Domov ali v Moji klubi (zvonec, zgoraj desno)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the invitation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri vabilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Accept to join, or Reject to decline.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Sprejmi, da se pridružiš, ali Zavrni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The club then shows under My Clubs, with the tools for your role.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klub se nato pokaže pod Moji klubi, z orodji za tvojo vlogo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To leave a team, open the club under My Clubs and tap Leave the team. The club can invite you again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ekipo zapustiš tako, da pod Moji klubi odpreš klub in tapneš Zapusti ekipo. Klub te lahko znova povabi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up VIP tables for an event, and take reservations by phone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nastavi VIP mize za dogodek in sprejemaj rezervacije po telefonu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the event and go to VIP tables.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odpri dogodek in pojdi na VIP mize."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Use the venue's layout, Own layout for this event or No VIP tables.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izberi Uporabi razpored prizorišča, Lasten razpored za ta dogodek ali Brez VIP miz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Edit tables and layout to add tables, drag them into place and set seats and price.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Z Uredi mize in tloris dodaš mize, jih povlečeš na mesto in nastaviš sedeže in ceno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To take a phone reservation, go to Dashboard > event > VIP reservations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rezervacijo po telefonu vneseš takole: Pregled > dogodek > VIP rezervacije."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a free table, tap Mark as reserved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pri prosti mizi tapni Označi kot rezervirano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the Guest name and a Note, and tap Reserve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vpiši Ime gosta in Opombo ter tapni Rezerviraj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To free the table again, tap Release.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni Sprosti, da mizo spet sprostiš."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the app says Set up VIP tables at outly.si/app, the floor plan and prices are set up there. Organizers without their own venue can also do it in the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Če aplikacija pove, da VIP mize nastaviš na outly.si/app, tloris in cene nastaviš tam. Organizatorji brez lastnega prizorišča to lahko naredijo tudi v aplikaciji."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Save the event first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Najprej shrani dogodek."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only owners and managers can take phone reservations.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To lahko naredita samo lastnik in upravitelj."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See which VIP tables have arrived and mark them as served.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poglej, katere VIP mize so prispele, in jih označi kot postrežene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap your club, then Table service.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tapni svoj klub, nato Strežba miz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the event at the top, if there is more than one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zgoraj izberi dogodek, če jih je več."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find the table in the list once door staff have scanned its VIP ticket.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mizo poišči na seznamu, ko vratar skenira njeno VIP vstopnico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Delivered once the table has been served.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ko je miza postrežena, tapni Dostavljeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tapped by mistake? Tap Undo.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Po pomoti? Tapni Razveljavi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owners, managers and bartenders can serve tables. Owners switch to their personal profile first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lastniki, upravitelji in natakarji strežejo mize. Lastniki se najprej preklopijo na osebni profil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each table shows its package and the time it was scanned.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vsaka miza ima prikazan paket in čas skena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list refreshes by itself; pull down to refresh it yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seznam se osvežuje sam; povleci navzdol, če ga želiš osvežiti sam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Staff also get a notification when a table is ready to serve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osebje dobi tudi obvestilo, ko je miza pripravljena za strežbo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test mode": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testni način"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows what test mode means": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pokaže, kaj pomeni testni način"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}